<title>FRANCE: Lyonnaise's Elyo buy costs FRF 500-600 mln.</title>
<headline>Lyonnaise's Elyo buy costs FRF 500-600 mln.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lyonnaise des Eaux managing director Guy de Panafieu said the buyout of the 21.7 percent of Elyo that it does not own will cost between 500 million and 600 million francs and will boost consolidated results.</p>
<p>He told a news conference that Lyonnaise had no plans for further minority buyouts at subsidiaries.</p>
</text>
